      "headline": "Fireworks Company Launches 'Silent But Deadly' Independence Day Line",
      "summary": "Explosions replaced with polite coughs and awkward silences.",
      "fullBody": "BoomBoom Inc. introduced their new line of fireworks that produce no sound but intense social discomfort. 'Perfect for quiet neighborhoods,' said the CEO while demonstrating a display that made everyone feel inexplicably embarrassed. Sales are exploding... quietly.",
